Limitations: I think you need a linux environment for this if it is made in linux. 

apptainers can be made using the following code:
conda install apptainer <------ if you do not already have it installed

build_apptainer.sh <name_of_sif> <name_of_specification_file> [env_name] [base_image]

Required:
sif - your output file and the file that you will actually use to run future code. 
	i.e. :~$ bioenv.sif DBL_order.py protein.fa -g plasmid.fa
spec file - This is the specification on what things you actually want to build in your container.
	An example is made in the file 'environment.yml'

optional:
env_name - you can change the environment name, it defaults to 'env'
base_image - you can change the base image (such as docker, miniforge, microforge, etc) 
	defaults to condaforge/miniforge3:latest
